{"id":"5YUPVTtHUhraIVPZ","meta":{"instanceId":"82c5bea520362e516241165c0caf720c8d29d2f0ba5e3cae2ba36d2c25d3b3b3"},"name":"Generate compliant e-invoices (EN 16931, XRechnung, Factur-X) with PDF Generator API","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"dc21f0ca-bbdd-444a-9084-1bcb497fae39","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1328,-592],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":896,"content":"## Generate compliant e-invoices (EN 16931, XRechnung, Factur-X) with PDF Generator API\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow generates standards-compliant e-invoices using PDF Generator API from either a manual sample invoice or a webhook-submitted invoice. It normalizes invoice data, applies configuration such as template ID and desired output format, maps the data into the required e-invoice payload, then routes the request to the Factur-X, XRechnung, or EN 16931 generation endpoint. The returned base64 document is parsed, converted into a file, and passed to a placeholder node where it can be stored or sent.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure PDF Generator API credentials or authentication headers in the HTTP Request nodes that call the e-invoice schema and generation endpoints.\n- Set the correct template_id, default_format, and facturx_profile values in the Settings node.\n- If using the webhook path, activate the workflow and configure the external invoice system to POST invoice data to the New invoice webhook URL.\n- Verify that incoming invoice fields match the mapping expected by the Sample invoice, Invoice from webhook, and Build e-invoice payload nodes.\n- Replace or extend the Store or send the file placeholder with the desired destination, such as email, cloud storage, ERP upload, or document management.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the Build e-invoice payload code to support additional invoice fields, tax rules, line item structures, or country-specific requirements. Change the routing logic or Settings values to choose which format is generated by default."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"3192aea6-3343-436a-9151-9d66d5019c9d","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-768,-176],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":704,"height":560,"content":"## Invoice intake and settings\n\nCollects invoice data either from a manual sample run or from a webhook, then applies shared configuration values before payload creation."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"40fcbfab-4ecd-4df7-98b1-d818e90aeda5","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-512,-592],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":384,"content":"## Schema lookup\n\nFetches the PDF Generator API e-invoice schema as a reference path from the manual trigger, visually separated above the main invoice flow."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"b5869e2f-a6c2-4043-988e-ef1923109c62","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[16,-144],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":384,"content":"## Build invoice payload\n\nMaps the normalized invoice fields into the Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 / UBL-style payload required for compliant e-invoice generation."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"65f95c60-49fa-45e5-ae61-75c7940b7fb8","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[288,-128],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":400,"content":"## Choose output format\n\nBranches the prepared payload according to the configured target format so the correct e-invoice endpoint is used."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e81ffadb-b084-436e-be8f-5d8d9c57b87c","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[576,-384],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":832,"content":"## Generate e-invoice document\n\nCalls the relevant PDF Generator API endpoint to create a Factur-X PDF with embedded XML, an XRechnung XML, or an EN 16931 XML document."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"2468d51f-c856-4e12-a882-b3c49de319eb","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[848,-128],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":368,"content":"## Parse API response\n\nReads the common response envelope returned by the generation endpoints and extracts the base64 document content and metadata."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"d59ffbef-44d2-4556-b21a-24e3b3d7ec62","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1120,-80],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":400,"height":320,"content":"## Create and hand off file\n\nConverts the decoded response into a file and passes it to a placeholder step for storage, delivery, or downstream processing."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"Run this workflow","name":"Manual Trigger Workflow","type":"n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger","position":[-720,-48],"parameters":{},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"New invoice (webhook)","name":"Webhook Trigger for Invoice","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[-720,208],"webhookId":"e6a9c3d2-1f44-4b07-9d21-7c5a8b0e4f13","parameters":{"path":"e-invoice","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST","responseMode":"lastNode"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"Settings","name":"Set Invoice Parameters","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","notes":"Edit these three values","position":[-208,80],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"a1","name":"template_id","type":"number","value":1656704},{"id":"a2","name":"default_format","type":"string","value":"facturx"},{"id":"a3","name":"facturx_profile","type":"string","value":"en16931"}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"notesInFlow":true,"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"Sample invoice","name":"Prepare Sample Invoice","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","notes":"Replace with your own data","position":[-464,-48],"parameters":{"mode":"raw","options":{},"jsonOutput":"{\n  \"format\": \"facturx\",\n  \"invoice_number\": \"2026-0042\",\n  \"issue_date\": \"2026-09-15\",\n  \"due_date\": \"2026-10-15\",\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"buyer_reference\": \"PO-88213\",\n  \"note\": \"Thank you for your business. Payment within 30 days.\",\n  \"payment_terms\": \"Payable within 30 days of the invoice date.\",\n  \"seller\": {\n    \"name\": \"Northwind Studio OU\",\n    \"contact_name\": \"Accounts Receivable\",\n    \"vat_id\": \"EE101234567\",\n    \"street\": \"Parnu mnt 12\",\n    \"city\": \"Tallinn\",\n    \"postal_code\": \"10148\",\n    \"country\": \"EE\",\n    \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+1234567890\",\n    \"iban\": \"EE471+1234567890\",\n    \"bic\": \"EEUHEE2X\",\n    \"legal_form\": \"Tallinn, Reg. 12345678\"\n  },\n  \"buyer\": {\n    \"name\": \"Blaumeier GmbH\",\n    \"vat_id\": \"DE276182595\",\n    \"street\": \"Hufeisenstr. 8\",\n    \"city\": \"Hattingen\",\n    \"postal_code\": \"45525\",\n    \"country\": \"DE\",\n    \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n    \"endpoint_id\": \"DE276182595\",\n    \"endpoint_scheme\": \"9930\"\n  },\n  \"lines\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Consulting services\",\n      \"description\": \"Implementation support, September 2026\",\n      \"quantity\": 10,\n      \"unit\": \"HUR\",\n      \"unit_price\": 120.0,\n      \"tax_percent\": 21\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Platform licence\",\n      \"description\": \"Monthly subscription\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"unit\": \"C62\",\n      \"unit_price\": 59.0,\n      \"tax_percent\": 21\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Support plan\",\n      \"description\": \"Priority support\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"unit\": \"C62\",\n      \"unit_price\": 90.0,\n      \"tax_percent\": 21\n    }\n  ]\n}"},"notesInFlow":true,"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"Invoice from webhook","name":"Prepare Webhook Invoice","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[-464,208],"parameters":{"mode":"raw","options":{},"jsonOutput":"={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}"},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"Get e-invoice schema","name":"Fetch E-Invoice Schema","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","notes":"Enable and run once when mapping your own fields","disabled":true,"position":[-464,-368],"parameters":{"url":"https://us1.pdfgeneratorapi.com/api/v4/einvoice/schema","options":{},"authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","nodeCredentialType":"pdfGeneratorApi"},"credentials":{"pdfGeneratorApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"PDF Generator account 2"}},"notesInFlow":true,"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"Build e-invoice payload","name":"Map to UBL Invoice Format","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[64,80],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Maps a flat invoice object onto the Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 UBL shape that\n// PDF Generator API expects. Run GET /einvoice/schema for the full field list.\nconst cfg = $('Set Invoice Parameters').first().json;\nconst out = [];\n\nconst money = (n) => (Math.round((Number(n) + Number.EPSILON) * 100) / 100).toFixed(2);\n\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const inv = item.json;\n  const cur = inv.currency || 'EUR';\n  const s = inv.seller || {};\n  const b = inv.buyer || {};\n\n  let net = 0;\n  const byRate = {};\n  const lines = (inv.lines || []).map((l, i) => {\n    const amount = Number(l.quantity) * Number(l.unit_price);\n    const rate = Number(l.tax_percent || 0);\n    net += amount;\n    byRate[rate] = (byRate[rate] || 0) + amount;\n\n    const line = {\n      'cbc:ID': String(i + 1),\n      'cbc:InvoicedQuantity': String(l.quantity),\n      'cbc:InvoicedQuantity@unitCode': l.unit || 'C62',\n      'cbc:LineExtensionAmount': money(amount),\n      'cbc:LineExtensionAmount@currencyID': cur,\n      'cac:Item': {\n        'cbc:Name': l.name,\n        'cac:ClassifiedTaxCategory': {\n          'cbc:ID': l.tax_category || 'S',\n          'cbc:Percent': money(rate),\n          'cac:TaxScheme': { 'cbc:ID': 'VAT' },\n        },\n      },\n      'cac:Price': {\n        'cbc:PriceAmount': money(l.unit_price),\n        'cbc:PriceAmount@currencyID': cur,\n      },\n    };\n    if (l.description) line['cac:Item']['cbc:Description'] = l.description;\n    return line;\n  });\n\n  let tax = 0;\n  const subtotals = Object.keys(byRate)\n    .map(Number)\n    .sort((a, z) => a - z)\n    .map((rate) => {\n      const base = byRate[rate];\n      const t = Math.round((base * rate) / 100 * 100 + Number.EPSILON) / 100;\n      tax += t;\n      return {\n        'cbc:TaxableAmount': money(base),\n        'cbc:TaxableAmount@currencyID': cur,\n        'cbc:TaxAmount': money(t),\n        'cbc:TaxAmount@currencyID': cur,\n        'cac:TaxCategory': {\n          'cbc:ID': 'S',\n          'cbc:Percent': money(rate),\n          'cac:TaxScheme': { 'cbc:ID': 'VAT' },\n        },\n      };\n    });\n\n  const ubl = {\n    'cbc:ID': inv.invoice_number,\n    'cbc:IssueDate': inv.issue_date,\n    'cbc:DueDate': inv.due_date,\n    'cbc:InvoiceTypeCode': '380',\n    'cbc:DocumentCurrencyCode': cur,\n    // BT-10. XRechnung (BR-DE-15) rejects the invoice without it.\n    'cbc:BuyerReference': inv.buyer_reference || inv.invoice_number,\n    'cac:AccountingSupplierParty': {\n      'cac:Party': {\n        'cbc:EndpointID': s.endpoint_id || s.email,\n        'cbc:EndpointID@schemeID': s.endpoint_scheme || 'EM',\n        'cac:PartyName': { 'cbc:Name': s.name },\n        'cac:PostalAddress': {\n          'cbc:StreetName': s.street,\n          'cbc:CityName': s.city,\n          'cbc:PostalZone': s.postal_code,\n          'cac:Country': { 'cbc:IdentificationCode': s.country },\n        },\n        // Supplier side must be an ARRAY, customer side an OBJECT.\n        'cac:PartyTaxScheme': [\n          { 'cbc:CompanyID': s.vat_id, 'cac:TaxScheme': { 'cbc:ID': 'VAT' } },\n        ],\n        'cac:PartyLegalEntity': {\n          'cbc:RegistrationName': s.name,\n          'cbc:CompanyLegalForm': s.legal_form || '',\n        },\n        // BT-41/42/43. XRechnung (BR-DE-5/6/7) requires all three.\n        'cac:Contact': {\n          'cbc:Name': s.contact_name || s.name,\n          'cbc:Telephone': s.phone,\n          'cbc:ElectronicMail': s.email,\n        },\n      },\n    },\n    'cac:AccountingCustomerParty': {\n      'cac:Party': {\n        'cbc:EndpointID': b.endpoint_id || b.email,\n        'cbc:EndpointID@schemeID': b.endpoint_scheme || 'EM',\n        'cac:PartyName': { 'cbc:Name': b.name },\n        'cac:PostalAddress': {\n          'cbc:StreetName': b.street,\n          'cbc:CityName': b.city,\n          'cbc:PostalZone': b.postal_code,\n          'cac:Country': { 'cbc:IdentificationCode': b.country },\n        },\n        'cac:PartyTaxScheme': {\n          'cbc:CompanyID': b.vat_id,\n          'cac:TaxScheme': { 'cbc:ID': 'VAT' },\n        },\n        'cac:PartyLegalEntity': { 'cbc:RegistrationName': b.name },\n      },\n    },\n    'cac:PaymentMeans': [\n      {\n        'cbc:PaymentMeansCode': '30',\n        'cac:PayeeFinancialAccount': {\n          'cbc:ID': s.iban,\n          'cbc:Name': s.name,\n          'cac:FinancialInstitutionBranch': { 'cbc:ID': s.bic },\n        },\n      },\n    ],\n    'cac:PaymentTerms': { 'cbc:Note': inv.payment_terms || `Due ${inv.due_date}` },\n    'cac:TaxTotal': [\n      {\n        'cbc:TaxAmount': money(tax),\n        'cbc:TaxAmount@currencyID': cur,\n        'cac:TaxSubtotal': subtotals,\n      },\n    ],\n    'cac:LegalMonetaryTotal': {\n      'cbc:LineExtensionAmount': money(net),\n      'cbc:LineExtensionAmount@currencyID': cur,\n      'cbc:TaxExclusiveAmount': money(net),\n      'cbc:TaxExclusiveAmount@currencyID': cur,\n      'cbc:TaxInclusiveAmount': money(net + tax),\n      'cbc:TaxInclusiveAmount@currencyID': cur,\n      'cbc:PayableAmount': money(net + tax),\n      'cbc:PayableAmount@currencyID': cur,\n    },\n    'cac:InvoiceLine': lines,\n  };\n  if (inv.note) ubl['cbc:Note'] = inv.note;\n\n  out.push({\n    json: {\n      format: (inv.format || cfg.default_format).toLowerCase(),\n      template_id: Number(inv.template_id || cfg.template_id),\n      profile: inv.profile || cfg.facturx_profile,\n      document_name: `Invoice ${inv.invoice_number}`,\n      invoice_number: inv.invoice_number,\n      ubl: { 'ubl:Invoice': ubl },\n    },\n  });\n}\n\nreturn out;\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"Route by format","name":"Route by Invoice Format","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[336,80],"parameters":{"rules":{"values":[{"outputKey":"Factur-X","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"r1","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.format }}","rightValue":"facturx"}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"XRechnung","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"r2","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.format }}","rightValue":"xrechnung"}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"EN 16931","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"r3","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.format }}","rightValue":"en16931"}]},"renameOutput":true}]},"options":{}},"typeVersion":3.2},{"id":"Factur-X (PDF + XML)","name":"Post to Factur-X Endpoint","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","notes":"POST /einvoice/facturx","position":[624,-128],"parameters":{"url":"https://us1.pdfgeneratorapi.com/api/v4/einvoice/facturx","method":"POST","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ template: { id: $json.template_id, data: $json.ubl }, profile: $json.profile, output: 'base64', name: $json.document_name }) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","nodeCredentialType":"pdfGeneratorApi"},"credentials":{"pdfGeneratorApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"PDF Generator account 2"}},"notesInFlow":true,"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"XRechnung (XML)","name":"Post to XRechnung Endpoint","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","notes":"POST /einvoice/xrechnung","position":[624,80],"parameters":{"url":"https://us1.pdfgeneratorapi.com/api/v4/einvoice/xrechnung","method":"POST","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ data: $json.ubl, type: 'UBL', output: 'base64' }) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","nodeCredentialType":"pdfGeneratorApi"},"credentials":{"pdfGeneratorApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"PDF Generator account 2"}},"notesInFlow":true,"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"EN 16931 (XML)","name":"Post to EN 16931 Endpoint","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","notes":"POST /einvoice","position":[624,288],"parameters":{"url":"https://us1.pdfgeneratorapi.com/api/v4/einvoice","method":"POST","options":{},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ data: $json.ubl, type: 'UBL', output: 'base64' }) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","nodeCredentialType":"pdfGeneratorApi"},"credentials":{"pdfGeneratorApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"PDF Generator account 2"}},"notesInFlow":true,"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"Read the response","name":"Parse API Response","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[896,80],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForEachItem","jsCode":"// The three endpoints return the same envelope: { response: <base64>, meta: {...} }.\n// content-type tells us which one we came from, so no branch-specific wiring is needed.\nconst meta = $json.meta || {};\nconst contentType = meta['content-type'] || 'application/xml';\nconst source = $('Map to UBL Invoice Format').item.json;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    invoice_number: source.invoice_number,\n    format: source.format,\n    file_name: meta.name || `${source.invoice_number}.${contentType === 'application/pdf' ? 'pdf' : 'xml'}`,\n    mime_type: contentType,\n    data: $json.response,\n  },\n};\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"Convert to file","name":"Convert Response to File","type":"n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile","position":[1168,80],"parameters":{"options":{"fileName":"={{ $json.file_name }}","mimeType":"={{ $json.mime_type }}"},"operation":"toBinary","sourceProperty":"data"},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"Store or send the file","name":"Store or Send Generated File","type":"n8n-nodes-base.noOp","notes":"Swap for Gmail / Drive / S3 / your ERP","position":[1376,80],"parameters":{},"notesInFlow":true,"typeVersion":1}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","callerPolicy":"workflowsFromSameOwner","availableInMCP":false,"executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"cf310ef2-8bbc-48dc-ad20-bf30349af392","connections":{"Parse API Response":{"main":[[{"node":"Convert Response to File","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Prepare Sample Invoice":{"main":[[{"node":"Set Invoice Parameters","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Set Invoice Parameters":{"main":[[{"node":"Map to UBL Invoice Format","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Manual Trigger Workflow":{"main":[[{"node":"Prepare Sample Invoice","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Fetch E-Invoice Schema","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Prepare Webhook Invoice":{"main":[[{"node":"Set Invoice Parameters","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Route by Invoice Format":{"main":[[{"node":"Post to Factur-X Endpoint","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Post to XRechnung Endpoint","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Post to EN 16931 Endpoint","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Convert Response to File":{"main":[[{"node":"Store or Send Generated File","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Map to UBL Invoice Format":{"main":[[{"node":"Route by Invoice Format","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Post to EN 16931 Endpoint":{"main":[[{"node":"Parse API Response","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Post to Factur-X Endpoint":{"main":[[{"node":"Parse API Response","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Post to XRechnung Endpoint":{"main":[[{"node":"Parse API Response","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Webhook Trigger for Invoice":{"main":[[{"node":"Prepare Webhook Invoice","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}